        "label": "What are the teleport anchors?",
        "lines": [
          "Anchors are old waystones set where travelers actually go. Stand beside one and it learns you.",
          "The early ones cost nothing. The Plaza, the Warren gate, the Quarry camp and Dunhollow are free, to make the first few leagues kinder.",
          "The rest need a Teleport Crystal, fifteen gold apiece. I don't set that price lightly. Each crystal is cut by hand and tuned to a single stone. Once you've attuned two anchors you can travel between them as often as you like, for nothing."
